        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshuwa ariphokala mtumia sana, Mwenyezi Mlungu wamuamba, “Uwe ukakala mtumia sana na kuchere na seemu kulu sana ambayo bado taidzangbwetekpwa ikale yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu hizo ni: tsi yosi ya Afilisti na tsi yosi ya Ageshuri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yani seemu imanyikanayo kama ya Akanani, kuandzira chidzuho cha Shihori chiricho mphaka wa Misiri hadi seemu za Ekironi iriyo uphande wa vurini. Maeneo gosi ga atawala atsano a Afilisti: Gaza, Ashidodi, Ashikeloni, Gathi na Ekironi phamwenga na eneo ra Aavi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kpwa uphande wa mwakani. Vivyo hivyo tsi yosi ya Akanani ni kuandzira Ara iriyo tsi ya Asidoni kpwenderera hadi Afeki kuriko na mphaka wa Aamori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vivyo hivyo eneo ra Gebali na Lebanoni iriyo mlairo wa dzuwa wa seemu ya Baali-Gadi tsini ya mwango Herimoni hadi phatu pha kumenyera Hamathi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.33.54"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 33:54",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "piya seemu za myango iriyo kahi-kahi ya Lebanoni na Misirefothi-Maimu ambayo enyezie ni Asidoni. Kadiri Aiziraeli ndivyoenderera kpwenye tsi hizo, mimi mwenye nindagazola mataifa higo mbere zenu. Nawe undaaganyira Aiziraeli seemu hizo dza vyo nrivyokulagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo undaganya tsi hizo kpwa Aiziraeli, zikale urisi wa hizo mbari tisiya na nusu ya mbari ya Manase.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
